  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/zipball/v0.0.61",
  "body": "## Fixes\n\n- Fix `pikpaktui update` downloading GitHub asset metadata instead of the actual checksum manifest and release archive. Both downloads now request `application/octet-stream`.\n- Keep SHA-256 verification mandatory before replacing the executable, and add regression tests for both download paths.\n\n## Upgrading\n\nIf your installed version reports `sha256sums.txt has no entry`, its updater still contains the old download logic. Upgrade once through Homebrew:\n\n```sh\nbrew update\nbrew upgrade Bengerthelorf/tap/pikpaktui\n```\n\nAlternatively, install the appropriate archive from this release after verifying it against `sha256sums.txt`, or use `cargo install pikpaktui --version 0.0.61 --locked --force`.\n\n## Validation\n\n319 tests passed, with strict Clippy and formatting checks. A controlled upgrade using the official checksum manifest and archive verified checksum validation, extraction, and executable replacement.\n\n[Full changelog: v0.0.60 to v0.0.61](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/compare/v0.0.60...v0.0.61)\n"
}
